cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research, please cite the repository and the exact commit or release tag used."
title: "Samsung Odyssey G5 G55C firmware reverse engineering"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "c8dhjp4tyv-bit"
    alias: "c8dhjp4tyv-bit"
repository-code: "https://github.com/c8dhjp4tyv-bit/odyssey-g5-firmware-research"
url: "https://github.com/c8dhjp4tyv-bit/odyssey-g5-firmware-research"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reproducible reverse-engineering notes, structural analysis tools, generated
  metadata catalogs, validation records, and a minimal data-only MGA factory-page
  visibility patch for the Samsung Odyssey G5 G55C model LS32CG552EUXUF and the
  exact pinned M-C5500GGZA-1010.0[D43B] base image. Samsung firmware is not
  redistributed by this project.
keywords:
  - firmware
  - reverse engineering
  - Samsung Odyssey G5
  - G55C
  - SPARC V8
  - 8051
  - embedded systems
